            <div xml:id="d819">

                <pb facs="0774" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg658"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 741.8215/49.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monrovia</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s May 14. Captain Young says Ballard capable of performing duties and
                    recommends his appointment on boundary commission. Liberian Government accepts
                    recommendation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Crum.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
